---
export const title = 'Variants';
export const order = 200;
import HighlighterCard from '../../../../components/HighlighterCard.astro';
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>Here are several predefined button styles, each serving its own semantic purpose.</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'} inline>
  <wc-icon-button variant='elevated'><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button variant='tonal'><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button variant='outlined'><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button variant='text'><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button variant='neo'><wc-icon name='home'></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
</DemoComponentCard>

<br/>

<style is:inline>
  strong {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>

<p>The <code class=text-code-block>level</code> property is a preset of <code>color</code> and <code>variant</code>, the same mapping as on <a href='/components/button'><code>wc-button</code></a>: <code>primary</code> (primary, filled), <code>secondary</code> (surface, tonal), <code>tertiary</code> (primary, text) and <code>danger</code> (danger, filled). A <code>color</code> or <code>variant</code> you set wins over the preset, and changing <code>level</code> later takes effect.</p>
<p><code>level="secondary"</code> used to give a filled icon button; it is now tonal, like the button.</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'} inline>
  <wc-icon-button level='primary' aria-label='Home'><wc-icon name="home"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button level='secondary' aria-label='Home'><wc-icon name="home"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button level='tertiary' aria-label='Home'><wc-icon name="home"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button level='danger' aria-label='Delete'><wc-icon name="delete"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
</DemoComponentCard>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'} inline>
  <wc-icon-button shape='square'><wc-icon name="home"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button shape='round'><wc-icon name="home"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button shape='narrow'><wc-icon name="more_vert"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
  <wc-icon-button shape='wide'><wc-icon name="edit"></wc-icon></wc-icon-button>
</DemoComponentCard>
